ng-paced hack n' slash roguelike</strong> set in a gothic, undying world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on movement abilities, split-second decision-making and stylish strings of attacks, <strong>BloodRush</strong> encourages a <strong>creative approach to combat</strong>, combining abilities to demolish your foes! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/f9a38de67247e2e11312bdf799a23a53.avif?t=1758277763\" width=616 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > String together <strong>new combos</strong> by combining weapon attacks with movement abilities; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Always a chance for comeback</strong> - rush to recover Blood by <strong>executing enemies</strong>; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting is dying - as your <strong>health constantly drains out</strong>, you must move quickly to escape death!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/502feb5c14a114246802a171fac6398d.poster.avif?t=1758277763\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/502feb5c14a114246802a171fac6398d.webm?t=1758277763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/502feb5c14a114246802a171fac6398d.mp4?t=1758277763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/63ffdaaa3d0a9883c00d1b9132c247a1.avif?t=1758277763\" width=616 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of enemies and bosses stand in the way of Death's liberation, forming the <strong>Cult of Eternity</strong>; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dance in eight <strong>combat arenas</strong>, each with different mechanics and challenges to interact with; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sharpen a <strong>different build</strong> every run with diverse weapon combinations, abilities and talents. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/6f84cac0858e256db93fae50ec2e3314.poster.avif?t=1758277763\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/6f84cac0858e256db93fae50ec2e3314.webm?t=1758277763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/6f84cac0858e256db93fae50ec2e3314.mp4?t=1758277763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471390/extras/a9fb3242cba5033842ca8bbd08bd6d75.avif?t=1758277763\" width=616 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into <strong>Death's domain</strong> in multiple runs, unlocking the Stranger's vast arsenal of <strong>6 weapons, 10+ combos, 20+ talents, and more</strong>; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover insights into Death's imprisonment, progressively learning more of her captors' <strong>motivations and philosophies</strong> at every run;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight in a beautiful pixel-art world, accompanied by a <strong>gothic-inspired</strong> <strong>soundtrack and atmosphere</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop